message: "If you use this data or analysis, please cite it as below."
title: "AGRO-BHARAT: Neem-based fertilizer for bell pepper — data and statistical analysis"
authors:
  - family-names: Grenadier Macaes
    given-names: Monica
  - family-names: Franchini Placido
    given-names: Laura
repository-code: "https://github.com/momacaes9/Research"
abstract: >-
  Experimental data and a reproducible statistical analysis (Python and R) of a
  10-week study testing whether an ethanolic extract of Indian Neem
  (Azadirachta indica) leaves increases the growth of bell pepper
  (Capsicum annuum) seedlings compared with water alone.
keywords:
  - neem
  - Azadirachta indica
  - bell pepper
  - natural fertilizer
  - mixed ANOVA
  - linear mixed model
